<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Upon the Son of Man</l><l>God’s Spirit did descend!</l><l>The Savior to anoint,</l><l>The Herald to appoint!</l><l>Bring gospel to the poor!</l><l>The broken hearts to cure!</l><l>The Jubilee has come!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>For captives, freedom claim!</l><l>Set liberty aflame!</l><l>Cause all the blind to see!</l><l>Their vision to receive!</l><l>Give all oppressed release!</l><l>From bondage set them free!</l><l>The Jubilee has come!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O speak this note of cheer!</l><l>Proclaim it far and near!</l><l>Where human sorrow’s found;</l><l>Where misery abounds!</l><l>The gospel now make plain!</l><l>Ring out the blessed refrain:</l><l>The Jubilee has come!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
